    "content": "<p><strong>1. Joining Fee:</strong> £697.00 (non-refundable).</p>\n<p><strong>2. Membership Fees:</strong> Payable by Direct Debit every 30 days: Business Class Membership — £87; First Class Membership — £127. The payment requirements in Section 6.2 apply.</p>\n<p><strong>3. Fees for Adding Team Members:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Additional agent fee: £150 per agent (non-refundable)</li>\n<li>Membership fee increase: 47% for each added team member</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. Late Payment Fee:</strong> £5 every 14 days while a Membership Fee remains overdue, in accordance with Section 6.4. No £25-per-recovery-attempt fee applies.</p>\n<p><strong>5. Departure Payments:</strong> Normal Membership Fees remain payable during the 30-day notice period and any continuing Option A self-management period under Section 16. No separate additional cancellation or final-month administration fee is created by giving notice.</p>\n<p><strong>6. Failed Option B Handover:</strong> The 2% transaction fee in Section 16.6.2 applies only to an affected booking where an Agent who chose Option B fails to complete the required handover within the notice period and that failure causes continued management work beyond the notice period. It is not a routine fee for Option A self-management or an orderly Option B handover.</p>"
